{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the depths of Hell in Hellscape, a challenging precision platformer where every step is a chance at redemption. Dodge deadly traps, explore treacherous paths, and meet the strange inhabitants of the Underworld! But tread lightly, for every action matters in the final judgment...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>EARLY DEVELOPMENT BUILD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hellscape is still in early development stages with lots of temporary art.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player tough-as-nails precision platformer where you face the Hell Trials, a series of brutal challenges and your <i><strong>one and only</strong></i> ticket out of Hell</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 unique and quirky traps that kill you in the most unexpected ways</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >150+ screens of hardcore platforming challenges and optional harder paths, delivered to you in a random bite-sized streak of 15 every time you hit PLAY</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optional (and often hard to obtain) memories to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pain and suffering</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Avoid traps and put your platforming skills to the test</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654020/extras/d902927b465d31d657d021ce8b197385.poster.avif?t=1769354533\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654020/extras/d902927b465d31d657d021ce8b197385.webm?t=1769354533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654020/extras/d902927b465d31d657d021ce8b197385.mp4?t=1769354533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Meet the weird inhabitants of the Underworld</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654020/extras/7c6a051a7242a13ebb9571265ae74326.poster.avif?t=1769354533\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654020/extras/7c6a051a7242a13ebb9571265ae74326.webm?t=1769354533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654020/extras/7c6a051a7242a13ebb9571265ae74326.mp4?t=1769354533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect optional memories to uncover Zakiel's past</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654020/extras/d15882387d95f40a12a814f409a14b6f.poster.avif?t=1769354533\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654020/extras/d15882387d95f40a12a814f409a14b6f.webm?t=1769354533\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3654020/extras/d15882387d95f40a12a814f409a14b6f.mp4?t=1769354533\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Move with absolute precision</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:/